  "description": "Ji-Eum learns that Seung-Jo, whom she’s had a crush on since high school, has a girlfriend. Desperate to pour out her heartache to someone, she stumbles upon a chat app called Thump-Thump Planet and meets “Jemulpo Gangju,” with whom she spends a brief escape from reality. Then, after winter break, she returns to school for the first time in a while.\n\n *“Wait a minute. Why is that person here?!”* \n\nThere, she comes face to face with “Jemulpo Gangju,” whom she thought she’d never see again…? \n\n*“Found you, Dolmengi.”*\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
